          "name": "Membrane demo (experimental)",
          "version": "0.1.0",
          "description": "Experimental, and set aside for now. A graph whose boundary is a custom outline: five Boundary nodes drawn from the root round to the root, the root being the sixth point; two of the sides are curved.",
          "updatedAt": "2026-10-26T22:39:48.933Z"
        },
